{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A LIST IN WORDS (Corvo addition)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Prints a list the way a sentence says it: "the size", "the size and the shape", "the size, the shape and the colours".

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* items: the words, separated by "§" (required)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign and_items = items | split: '§'
  assign and_word = 'rug_page.and' | t
-%}

{%- for and_item in and_items -%}
  {%- if forloop.first -%}
    {{- and_item | strip -}}
  {%- elsif forloop.last %} {{ and_word }} {{ and_item | strip -}}
  {%- else -%}
    , {{ and_item | strip -}}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
